{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941140/extras/8b40656dc3752d8bddb6b1d246e2d28c.poster.avif?t=1755540269\" width=1400 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941140/extras/8b40656dc3752d8bddb6b1d246e2d28c.webm?t=1755540269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Barrel Roll is a turn-based roguelike deckbuilder but we replaced the deck with a six slot revolver barrel.</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941140/extras/452228c97633f0b1a24af8e65e45e431.avif?t=1755540269\" width=1200 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941140/extras/40f7ed10b5ac8e689bb8f40f51a5c67b.poster.avif?t=1755540269\" width=780 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941140/extras/40f7ed10b5ac8e689bb8f40f51a5c67b.webm?t=1755540269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take down hordes of outlaws to get to their leaders. Collect bullets with special effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of your bullets has its archetype (Damage, Shield, Initiative, Focus and Killer). It's up to you to customize your ideal barrel et create powerful synergies to counter your enemies !\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941140/extras/f0e4ced1f3c100cfcf0b63fb52b40ea3.avif?t=1755540269\" width=1200 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941140/extras/60382475fbe594cf9e5d8e52a1cf1a7e.poster.avif?t=1755540269\" width=780 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941140/extras/60382475fbe594cf9e5d8e52a1cf1a7e.webm?t=1755540269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claim your first bounty in this 40min long demo. After each of your shots, choose your next bullet between the 3 next and come up with mind blowing combos ! (Litterally...)  <br>Crush your opponents (at least their shield) to delay their next turn and use one of your 3 skills to show your mastery and turn the duel upside down.\u00a0   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>So will you get the hang of it ? Or should we start digging your grave ?</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>In this demo you'll find...</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >64 <strong>bullets</strong> with powerful effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 <strong>skills</strong> to get out of every situations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 <strong>bounties</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3941140?t=1755540269","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941140/46369465ba8361646af23d70b0913837635cff1f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755540269","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941140/76bec26c49a6ac3fdcadbc4b33ef6d77461b601a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755540269","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/39411