arrel et create powerful synergies to counter your enemies !\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941140/extras/f0e4ced1f3c100cfcf0b63fb52b40ea3.avif?t=1755540269\" width=1200 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941140/extras/60382475fbe594cf9e5d8e52a1cf1a7e.poster.avif?t=1755540269\" width=780 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941140/extras/60382475fbe594cf9e5d8e52a1cf1a7e.webm?t=1755540269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claim your first bounty in this 40min long demo. After each of your shots, choose your next bullet between the 3 next and come up with mind blowing combos ! (Litterally...)  <br>Crush your opponents (at least their shield) to delay their next turn and use one of your 3 skills to show your mastery and turn the duel upside down.\u00a0   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>So will you get the hang of it ? Or should we start digging your grave ?</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>In this demo you'll find...</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >64 <strong>bullets</strong> with powerful effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 <strong>skills</strong> to get out of every situations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 <strong>bounties</strong></p></li></ul>","developers":["Barrel Roll"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3860590","name":"Barrel Roll"},"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941140/14f37dc3a6f8f75